	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">The concept of a cluster is the core group within a Yomonsni lifestyle. Rather than seeking exclusive pair bonds, within Yomonsni the smallest grouping that is desired is on the order of 5 to 8 individuals. The ability within a group this size to know, care for, and support each other is key to promoting good health of Yom, Mon, and Sni.</p>
